# PRODUCTION settings for the website (git-ignored), like bukuresipi-hono's .env.
#   PUBLIC_*  build settings, read by `astro build` / `bun run deploy`. Public: baked into the site's HTML/JS.
#   others    secrets of the website Worker (bukuresipi-web) -> `bun run secrets:push` (PUBLIC_* are skipped).
# Cloudflare never returns secret values, so this file is the only copy you can read back.
# Empty values are skipped, so a blank line never wipes a live secret.
# Local dev: .env.development (committed) overrides PUBLIC_* for `astro dev`.

# The API Worker (bukuresipi-hono); it allows this site's origin by CORS (its WEB_ORIGIN var).
PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.bukuresipi.com

# Worker secrets: none yet (the site is static). Add one when worker/index.ts reads it, e.g.:
# TURNSTILE_SECRET=
